iputc.com,0,"iPerform University &amp; Training Center — AI Programs, Verified by Humans AI builds your training and nutrition program in seconds. A NASM-certified corrective exercise and performance specialist verifies it before you train. iPerform University & Training Center — AI Programs, Verified by Humans iPerform University & Training Center Home About Library Pricing FAQ Contact Start free program Est. for the evidence-minded AI writes the program. A certified human signs it. Artificial intelligence is fast and confidently wrong. iPerform University pairs an AI program builder with paid review from certified corrective exercise, performance enhancement, and nutrition specialists — so you know what is real and what is marketing. Meet your specialist How it works Every AI output is labelled unverified until a credentialed specialist reviews it How it works Three steps between a prompt and a program you can trust 0 1 AI drafts the program Structured intake — goals, injury history, equipment, training age — feeds a model trained to program within evidence-based constraints. 0 2 A specialist reviews it Submit the draft for human review. A credentialed specialist annotates, corrects, and explains the reasoning line by line. 0 3 It ships verified Approved programs carry a verification stamp with the reviewer's name, credentials, and date. No stamp, no confidence. Inside the university Built like a curriculum, not a feed Exercise science video library Movement breakdowns with the mechanics behind them — corrective, performance, MMA conditioning, senior, and weight loss tracks. Curated research library Hand-selected studies with a plain-language takeaway, the population studied, and what it actually changes in practice. Supplement & nutrient database Evidence-graded entries on supplements, macros, and micronutrients — effects, dosage ranges, timing, and cautions, with citations. Live one-on-one consults Have a question about an exercise? Book an hour with the specialist Some answers do not fit in an article. Book a one-hour live video session with a certified trainer, corrective exercise specialist, or performance coach to walk through a specific exercise, review your form on camera, or pressure-test the program you are running. Book a one-hour session One-off sessions, paid at booking. Coaching only — consults are not medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. One hour, face to face A private live video session with a certified trainer, corrective exercise specialist, or performance coach — not a chatbot, not a forum. Bring one question, or ten Stuck on a squat pattern, a nagging tweak, an exercise in your program, or whether your form is right? Screen-share your program or send clips in advance. Booked around your schedule Pick a specialist, pick a time from their calendar, pay once. Sessions are booked and paid through iPUTC — no subscriptions required. Notes after the call You leave with a written summary of what was covered and any program adjustments the specialist recommends. Clinical referral network When it belongs with a clinician, we hand you to one Some questions sit above a trainer’s scope. For those, choose a licensed provider from our vetted network. You book and pay on the provider’s own scheduling page — care is delivered by them, under their license, in their practice. Physical therapists (DPT) Pain, post-op rehab, and persistent movement dysfunction that needs hands-on assessment and a licensed plan of care. PAs & nurse practitioners Labs, medication questions, hormone and metabolic health, and anything that requires a prescriber and a chart. Registered dietitians & specialists Clinical nutrition, medical conditions, and cases where evidence-based coaching alone is not the right tool. 0 1 Flagged in review During expert review, anything outside coaching scope is marked and matched to the right kind of licensed provider. 0 2 Book on their site Each listing links straight to that provider's own website and scheduler. You book and pay them directly. 0 3 Findings come back With your consent, the provider's guidance is folded into your program so training and care stay aligned. Scope & responsibility. Listed providers are independent practitioners — 10"
