e services We repair all major brands & models — every symptom is unique. Refrigerators Freezers Washers Dryers Dishwashers Ovens & Ranges Our repair process From diagnosis to solution — clear, step by step. Listen & assess We talk about the symptom, inspect, and identify the root cause. Explain & quote Transparent diagnosis, no hidden fees, you decide. Repair with care Precise work, clean environment, respect for your home. Test & follow-up We ensure performance and remain available for questions. Why choose Mirevona Attentive diagnosis We focus on the nuance, not just the breakdown. Every symptom matters. Timely & clear We respect your schedule, communicate plainly, and arrive ready. Property care Clean work, protective measures, and professional treatment of your home. 24/7 availability We're here around the clock — because appliance trouble doesn't wait. Frequently asked questions Do you repair all major brands? ▼ Yes, we service refrigerators, freezers, washers, dryers, dishwashers, ovens, and ranges from most brands. We focus on the symptom, not the label. What areas do you serve? ▼ We are based in St. Augustine and serve the greater St. Augustine area. Contact us to confirm availability for your location. Are you available on weekends? ▼ Yes, we offer 24/7 service including weekends and holidays. Call (904) 617-3328 for immediate assistance. Do you provide a warranty on repairs? ▼ We stand behind our work. Please ask about our repair warranty when we diagnose your appliance. Contact us Address: 1111 US-1, St. Augustine, FL 32084 Hours: 24 hours / 7 days Email: connect@mirevonaappliancerepairstaugustine.site Phone: (904) 617-3328 Call (904) 617-3328 Mirevona Appliance Repair St. Augustine © 2025 · Appliance repair with care (904) 617-3328 Contact"
