qaisbio.com,0,"QAIbio | AI & Biotechnology Technology for a Healthier Tomorrow. QAIbio operates at the intersection of artificial intelligence, life sciences, microbiome research, and data science. QAIbio | AI & Biotechnology QAI bio About QAIbio Research & Technology Leadership Our Approach Community Contact About QAIbio Research & Technology Leadership Our Approach Community Contact Computing Health. Atomic Precision. QAIbio operates at the intersection of artificial intelligence, life sciences, microbiome research, and data science. We translate vast biological complexity into precise, individualized health interventions. Discover Our Science 01 / The Company About QAIbio QAIbio is a technology company operating at the intersection of artificial intelligence, life sciences, microbiome research, and data science. Backed by strategic investment from QAI, our purpose is to translate vast biological complexity into precise, individualized health insights. AI Driven Analysis Bio Complex Data 01 What We Do Our work focuses deeply on understanding complex biological and health-related data. While traditional software systems process structured data, human biological data is highly diverse and incomplete. We navigate this complexity to better understand the distinct physiological differences between individuals and explore personalized approaches to health interventions. 02 Our Vision At our core, QAIbio is driven by the philosophy that technology should ultimately serve people. We believe truly valuable technology solves real problems and creates lasting value. The true value of AI is not to replace life sciences, but to serve as a powerful tool to identify overlooked patterns within complex biological datasets. 02 / Innovation Research & Technology PyTorch TensorFlow XGBoost SHAP LIME AI & Life Sciences We bridge data science and life sciences, using machine learning to analyze relationships between probiotics, the gut microbiome, and individual nutritional responses. By exploring factors like gut composition and metabolic data, our research aims to build advanced models for individual nutritional response prediction. Our research focuses on using machine learning and artificial intelligence to analyze relationships between probiotics, the gut microbiome, and individual nutritional responses. We work to extract strain-level characteristics from complex probiotic and microbial datasets, establishing relationships among strains, nutrition, metabolic indicators, and individual responses, and using these datasets for machine learning model training. During model development, our relevant research expertise leverages PyTorch, TensorFlow, and XGBoost to explore probiotic intervention outcomes. We also use hyperparameter optimization, model validation, and explainability techniques such as SHAP and LIME to improve model stability and interpretability. One of the key areas we focus on is the research and development of an individual nutritional response prediction model. This model integrates gut microbiome composition, dietary records, basal metabolic information, and individual behavioral data to explore how different individuals may respond differently to nutritional and probiotic interventions. By identifying potentially overlooked patterns within large and complex biological datasets, we aim to better understand physiological differences between individuals. 03 / People Leadership ALYA JONES CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER Alya bridges the gap between deep computational intelligence and life sciences, leading QAIbio's mission to build technologies that solve real problems and create lasting human value. 15+ Years Exp NUS & Harvard Alumni AI × Bio Focus Core Expertise Computational Biology AI / Machine Learning Microbiome Data Strategic Leadership READ FULL BIO → EARLY YEARS & EDUCATION Born in Singapore in 1986, Alya Jones has always been driven by the intersection of mathematics, computer science, and logical thinking. After completing her A-Levels in 2004, she enrolled at the National University of Singapore (NUS) to study Computer Science, where she led innovation projects, including an intelligent class-scheduling system. FROM SOF"
qelzunaro.shop,0,"qelzunaro qelzunaro Skip to content QELZUNARO Home Product Features FAQ Cart (0) View product ☰ Precision bearing and seal service Install bearings and seals with a purpose-built manual driver kit. A precision service kit with interchangeable alloy discs, a knurled impact handle, and a rugged black carry case for organized storage and controlled installation. €59,00 In stock SKU: QELZUNARO-BSD-KIT View product Explore features Manual service kit • interchangeable alloy discs • rugged carry case Interchangeable driver discs Manual impact control Black rugged carry case Organized hard carry case Complete set Everything you need in one organized kit The complete kit keeps the driver handle, discs and accessories together for cleaner, more consistent service work. Premium materials Knurled grip and durable alloy construction Champagne-bronze alloy discs, a textured black handle and a rugged black carry case create a durable, workshop-ready kit. Easy setup Simple three-step installation workflow Choose the right disc, place it over the bearing or seal, and apply controlled force for accurate installation. Where it fits Designed for mechanical service work A manual driver system for automotive, motorcycle, bicycle and general workshop service. Automotive bearings Wheel hub and bearing service tasks. Oil seals Seat seals with a matched driver surface. Motorcycle hubs Useful for selected bearing and seal work. Workshop machinery General bearing, race and bushing service. Tool + kit design Core features based on the supplied product information The specifications below reflect the tool configuration shown in the supplied product visuals. Tool type Manual bearing and seal driver kit Driver system Interchangeable alloy discs Handle Knurled black impact handle Color system Champagne bronze + black rugged case Power source Manual — no battery platform Storage Hard carrying case Product naming Descriptive title without model number Use Automotive and workshop service Organization Protected storage keeps every part ready Foam storage and organized compartments help protect the handle, discs and small accessories between jobs. Applications Made for multi-surface mechanical service Useful for bearings, seals, races and selected bushing installation tasks in automotive and workshop environments. Help Frequently asked questions Setup, use and care guidance based on the supplied product information. What is this kit designed for? + It is designed for controlled installation of bearings, seals, races and selected bushings during automotive and workshop service. Is this a cordless power tool? + No. This is a manual specialty driver kit and does not use a battery or motor. How do I choose a driver disc? + Choose a disc size that matches the component being installed so force is distributed evenly. What makes the handle different? + The handle uses a knurled non-slip grip and a durable construction for better control during installation. What comes in the kit? + The kit includes the driver handle, interchangeable alloy discs, a precision control tip, a durable carry case and accessory items shown in the product images. Where can it be used? + It is useful for automotive wheel hubs, motorcycle service, bicycle hubs and general workshop maintenance. Shop the tool Open the product page to view the live listing and complete set details. The theme is preloaded with the updated QELZUNARO main images and detail assets for a cleaner product presentation. View product QELZUNARO Manual bearing, seal and workshop service tools designed for controlled automotive maintenance. Navigation Home Product Features FAQ Cart Policies Return and Refund Policy Privacy Policy Terms of Service Shipping Policy Contact Information Legal Notice / Impressum © 2026 qelzunaro. All rights reserved."
