varadero60restaurante.com,0,"Home - Varadero60 Restaurant Home - Varadero60 Restaurant Skip to content Home About Us Menu Contact English Español Русский English Reserva Reserva Home About Us Menu Contact English Español Русский English Varadero 60 Restaurant Living the Memory Relive the nostalgia of the 60s in every dish: Our menu invites you to enjoy a delicious meal set in the 60s, where flavors and aesthetics blend in perfect harmony. Menu Read more Charcoal cooking Authentic and juicy flavors At Varadero60, we take pride in offering a unique culinary experience with our charcoal cooking. Using only the freshest ingredients, our chefs prepare dishes that burst with authentic flavors and unforgettable aromas. Every bite is an adventure for your senses, thanks to the charcoal cooking technique we use to give our dishes that smoky, juicy flavor that only charcoal can offer. Explore our delicious menu Whole Charcoal-Grilled Fish: flavors that will take you to paradise A dish that will delight your senses Immerse yourself in a feast of flavors with our Whole Charcoal-Grilled Fish. Expertly prepared and slowly cooked over the embers, this dish will transport you to a culinary paradise. Every bite is an explosion of smoky and juicy flavors that will captivate you from the first moment. Enjoy the freshness of the fish and its tender texture, enhanced by the special touch of charcoal. If you’re a fan of intense and authentic flavors, you can’t miss the opportunity to try our Whole Charcoal-Grilled Fish. Come and let yourself be enveloped in this gastronomic delight that you will never forget. Enjoy our irresistible menu Octopus Carpaccio: a wave of flavors that will captivate you Experience the delicacy of thin slices of octopus marinated in a seductive and exquisite citrus sauce Immerse yourself in a world of flavors with our delicious Octopus Carpaccio. Every bite is an explosion of flavors that you won’t be able to resist. Made with the freshest ingredients and a seductive citrus sauce, our Octopus Carpaccio is an opportunity you can’t miss. Enjoy it as an appetizer or as a main course, this is a dish that will undoubtedly please any palate. Come and try this delicious specialty at our restaurant today. Discover our exquisite selection of dishes The Best Chefs Discover the Art of Fine Dining at Our Restaurant. At our exclusive restaurant, we have the best chefs who will delight your senses with unique culinary creations. Our team of culinary masters has been carefully selected for their exceptional talent and unmatched passion for gastronomy. Meet the Team Loved by all 100% customer satisfaction “I had an unforgettable experience at Varadero 60. The Whole Grilled Fish was simply spectacular. The restaurant atmosphere is charming and the service was exceptional. I highly recommend trying this iconic dish at Varadero 60. You won’t regret indulging in this delight!” Jennifer Satisfied customer Discover and Savor! Come to Varadero 60, you'll surely love it Discover and Enjoy! Come and let yourself be captivated by our delicious charcoal cuisine. You will be surprised by the intense flavors we achieve through our unique cooking technique. Additionally, you can delight in live music performed by talented musicians, creating a cozy and lively atmosphere. Don’t miss the opportunity to live an unforgettable experience where each bite and musical note will transport you to a unique journey. We look forward to welcoming you to share special moments together! Reservation Contact us through 60th Street corner 3rd Avenue +53 50 99 03 88 info@varadero60restaurante.com Our Schedules Tuesday Wednesday Thursday Friday Saturday Sunday 17:30 – 22:30 17:30 – 22:30 17:30 – 22:30 17:30 – 22:30 17:30 – 22:30 17:30 – 22:30 Reservations Make a reservation before your visit and avoid wait times. Book now! O Llámanos : +53 50 99 03 88 Copyright © 2026 Varadero60 Restaurant Desarrollado por: CreceTuWeb"
variedadessamuel.site,0,"Variedades Samuel | Tecnología y accesorios en Cartagena Tienda de tecnología y accesorios en Cartagena: relojes inteligentes, accesorios y artículos para el hogar y uso personal. Domicilio o recogida. Variedades Samuel | Tecnología y accesorios en Cartagena Saltar al contenido Variedades Samuel Productos Producto Qué buscas Quiénes somos Contacto Pedir Productos · Cartagena Tecnología que conecta, accesorios que completan Productos tecnológicos, accesorios y artículos para el hogar y uso personal, con disponibilidad constante y entrega oportuna en Cartagena. Ver el producto Preguntar por algo Domicilio o recogida Entrega oportuna Inventario que rota Conectividad Bluetooth Precio $50.000 Colores 4 opciones desliza Tecnología Accesorios Hogar Uso personal Ref. 01 Disponible ahora Reloj inteligente Reloj inteligente con conectividad Bluetooth y pantalla táctil. Precio $50.000 pesos Conectividad Bluetooth Pantalla táctil a color Mide pasos, distancia y calorías Colores Negro Azul Rosa Gris Entrega Domicilio o recogida · Cartagena Agregar al carrito Ver la ficha completa Precios en pesos colombianos. El inventario cambia según la disponibilidad; confirma por WhatsApp antes de pedir. Qué buscas Lo que tenemos cambia; pregunta por lo tuyo El catálogo se mueve según lo que llega y lo que más piden. Estas son las líneas que trabajamos; escríbenos y te decimos qué hay hoy. Tecnología Relojes inteligentes, audio y dispositivos de uso diario. Accesorios Complementos para tu celular, tu computador y tu día. Hogar Artículos prácticos para la casa. Uso personal Productos de uso personal que la gente pide. Escríbenos qué buscas Te decimos si lo tenemos o cuándo llega. Quiénes somos Un emprendimiento que crece Somos una empresa dedicada a la comercialización de una amplia variedad de productos: tecnología, accesorios, artículos para el hogar, productos de uso personal y otros de interés para nuestros clientes. Nuestro propósito es ofrecer productos de calid